SUMMARY:Littles Monster Mash & Parade (ages 0-5)
DESCRIPTION:Little friends of the Library! Come in your costume before the 
 31st. We will dance the Monster Mash and sing some Halloween songs. Then we 
 will parade around the library to say “boo!” and trick-or-treat in our 
 library departments.  \n\n
