 eone remembered in our prayers on Sunday\, November 1\, please email (mai
 lto:office@holyspiritverona.org?subject=Names%20For%20All%20Saints%20Day)
  our Parish Administrator\, Catherine Tamasik (office@holyspiritverona.or
 g (mailto:office@holyspiritverona.org))\,or write the person(s) name(s) on
  the sheet in the Fellowship Hall.
