DESCRIPTION:<span><span>The Heavenly Finds Thrift Shop\, located in Living
 ston\, is open<span> </span></span><b><b>most Mondays (as of September 20
 26) from 10 am - 2 pm</b></b><span>. Proceeds from the thrift shop are use
 d to support many local organizations\, including those that focus on food
  insecurity and youth services. Donations are accepted any time except Sun
 day afternoons and Monday mornings. For more information please visit </
