 ng your creativity!\nWhether you’re a plant lover or just looking for som
 ething fun to do with friends\, this is your chance to get creative\, lea
 rn something new\, and take home your own living creation!\nCome build. C
 reate. Grow! \n\nHosted by: Environmental Club\n\nAdditional Information 
 can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12898096
