SUMMARY:[Outside Org]  Referendum (A screening)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening of Referendum\, a short documentary 
 exploring Montclair’s school budget crisis and the community’s fight 
 over the future of its public schools.\n\nFollowing the film\, a panel will 
 discuss the issues raised in the documentary and what comes next for 
 Montclair. The panel will include:\n\n- The Montclair Pod\n\n- 4th Ward 
 Councilor Aminah Toler\n\n- Former BOE Member Kathryn Weller-Demming\n\n- 
 MPACT Founder Dan Hafetz\n\nFilm Runtime: 30 minutes
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium
