DESCRIPTION:After services\, we will enjoy a community potluck dinner foll
 owing by the screening of the documentary\, Periphery (2021).Periphery is 
 a short documentary about ethnic diversity in the Jewish community in Toro
 nto\, Canada\, sharing the richness of Jewish identity and cultural expres
 sion while illustrating the feeling of grappling to belong. Discussion fol
 lowing led by Rabbi Marc Katz.Register Here!
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/tnt-film-festival-periphery-screening/
