DESCRIPTION:MoniCon is a 2-Day Event providing the full fledged Convention
  experience right here on Montclair State University's Main Campus! Here 
 at MoniCon we have a little something for everyone\, so you will not want
  to miss out on this one of a kind event! Some of our many activities wil
 l include\, Performances\, Cosplay\, Fursuits\, a Game Room\, an Artist A
 lley\, Panels\, Live Music\, and more! MoniCon is an event made by studen
 ts for everyone making it the perfect way to enjoy your weekend with an a
 mazing experience!\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖When & Where?.𖥔 ݁ ˖MoniCon will take place fr
 om November 6th through November 7th 2026 on Montclair State University's
  Main Campus. The event will encompase both the Student Center and Univer
 sity Hall Buildings. MoniCon's hours of operations are 10:00AM-10:00PM on
  November 6th and 10:00PM-10:00PM on November 7th.\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖How To Join?.�
 � ݁ ˖You can RSVP on any of the events labeled MoniCon\, you do not have 
 to RSVP to all of them in order to attend only one is ok! Event Passes wi
 ll be eligable for purchase at the door and will be $10 for students and 
 $20 for non students. If you would like to prepurchase a ticket online pl
 ease check out our EventBrite to secure your spot early!\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖About Us
 .𖥔 ݁ ˖MoniCon is created as a community effort by the Montclair State Fu
 rry Club\, Garfield Club\, Aurora\, Splatoon Club\, Montclair Univeristy 
 Gamers\, Art Society\, and Japan Club all in pursuits of making a unique 
 and exciting event. If any of these clubs individually catch your eye che
 ck out their engage pages to learn more about the amazing oppertunities t
 hey individually bring to campus life.\n.𖥔 ݁ ˖More Information.𖥔 ݁ ˖For
  more information about this event please check out MoniConvention on Ins
 tagram or our linktree https://linktr.ee/monicon\n\nHosted by: Garfield c
 lub\, Japan Club\, Montclair University Gamers (M.U.G.)\, Montclair Splat
 oon Club\, Montclair State University Furry Club\n\nAdditional Informatio
 n can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12910602
DTEND:20261108T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052256Z
DTSTART:20261107T150000Z
LOCATION:Student Center 417 - Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
