SUMMARY:Graphic Novel Book Club (18 ) Parable of the Sower Graphic Novel Adaptation by Damian Duffy\, originally written by Octavia Butler
DESCRIPTION:Parable of the Sower: A Graphic Novel Adaptation  Adapted by 
 Damian Duffy\, illustrated by John Jennings\, and originally written by 
 Octavia E. Butler.\n\nThe acclaimed graphic novel adaptation of Octavia E. 
 Butler’s groundbreaking dystopian novel\, Parable of the Sower\, is a 
 don't-miss classic that resonates today more than ever. As The Washington 
 Post noted: “A 1993 dystopian novel imagined the world in 2024. It’s 
 eerily accurate.” (Amazon)\n\nCopies of the book will be available to 
 pick up at the BAB Library. \n\nRegistration is required.\n\nThis book club 
 is exclusive for those 18 or older\, as some materials may contain content 
 not suitable for younger audiences.\n\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch":MAILTO:branch-events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Bellevue Avenue Branch, Book Discussion, Book Club
