SUMMARY:Planning Your Financial Future: Retirement By Design
DESCRIPTION:Retirement by Design is a presentation that illustrates how you 
 can translate your vision for retirement into tangible goals. Whether you 
 are 10 or 40 years from retirement\, you’ll learn investment strategies 
 to help design the retirement you want. We’ll also discuss ways to make 
 your strategy more flexible\, helping you manage unexpected events and stay 
 on track.\n\nSign up for other events in this series: Foundations of 
 Investing\n\nPresenter Bio:\nJose (Dre') Martin\, Chartered Retirement 
 Planning Counselor™\nJose' runs a comprehensive wealth management 
 practice at Edward Jones in Florham Park\, where he has been helping 
 families and individuals make sense of their finances.  With over 20 years 
 of experience working at Wall Street firms like JP Morgan\, Morgan 
 Stanley\, and UBS\, Jose has seen firsthand the importance of financial 
 guidance\; and he has made it his mission to share that knowledge in a way 
 that's clear\, practical\, and uplifting.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Finances
UID:LibCal-10306-17749377
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17749377
