DESCRIPTION:Give back to the community\, one donation at a time. Join LASO
  for Ropa con Propósito\, a community service event dedicated to raising 
 awareness about clothing insecurity and helping those in need. Donate gen
 tly used clothing\, learn about the impact of clothing access on individu
 als and families\, and help make a difference in our local community. Tog
