 ted for attendance you must make a fundraiser account through the followi
 ng portal:https://www.sleepout.org/team/14720. *\nThe goal is to raise $2
 5\,000. We encourage you to join to the team or donate to the cause! Ever
 y dollar counts.\n\nHosted by: Office of Community Engagement and Partner
 ships\, Volunteer Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https
