SUMMARY:Cricut - Mini Book Ornaments
DESCRIPTION:\n\nBack by popular demand\, we are making Book Ornaments -- 
 tiny versions of books\, inside a clear plastic ornament.\n\nA great way to 
 showcase your favorite books of the year\, or your favorites of all time.  
 Also makes a great gift!\n\n*You MUST submit a list of your top 10-15 books 
 ASAP upon registration -- if possible\, before 12/11\, but definitely by 
 12/17 at the LATEST.  We will be printing out sheets of book covers for you 
 to use\, and it takes time to find the graphics and resize them.  If you do 
 not submit a list of books you may not be able to participate.*\n\nSend 
 your list to marisa.treglio@nutley.bccls.org and put "Book Ornaments" in 
 the subject line.  Alternatively\, drop off your list at the reference desk 
 -- make sure your name is on it!\n\nAll supplies provided.  No Cricut 
 machine or experience necessary.\n\nOnline registration is required and 
 limited to 20 Nutley adults.  ONLY REGISTER FOR ONE SESSION!\n\n \n\n
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Craft
UID:LibCal-10315-17935055
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17935055
END:VEVENT
