SEQUENCE:2
CREATED:20240220T194630Z
DESCRIPTION:"Our group provides participants an opportunity to honor Jewis
 h heritage\, share cultural or religious memories and explore feelings abo
 ut our dual identity as UU and Jewish. The group is open to all members an
 d friends of UUCM who have Jewish roots or an interest in learning more ab
 out Jewish customs and culture."<br><br>UUCM B is inviting you to a schedu
 led Zoom meeting. <br>Join Zoom Meeting:<br> <a href="https://us06web.zo
 om.us/j/85352443994?pwd=WsjDgsfmxyiUEBTGsiBr1qG2xgabJl.1"><u>https://us06w
 eb.zoom.us/j/85352443994?pwd=WsjDgsfmxyiUEBTGsiBr1qG2xgabJl.1</u></a> <br
 ><br>Meeting ID: 853 5244 3994 <br>Passcode: UUCM
